            <div type="researchHistory">
               <p xml:space="preserve">This dialect was linguistically investigated within the TUNOCENT project, which resulted in the following publication: <rs type="bibl" ref="zotid:5TEEAD39">Ritt-Benmimoun (2022)</rs>
                     </p>
